# Large generated artifacts (untracked; regenerable)
# ============================
*.pdf
!paper/*.pdf
!paper/ACDSA_latex/*.pdf
!paper/IEEE-conference-template-062824/*.pdf
*.json
!**/calibration.json
!config/**/*.json
